### SKILL.md  [instructions]
- AI-First credential store on Dash Platform. Encrypts secrets with Scheme C
- (Identity ECDH + HKDF-SHA256 + AES-256-GCM) and stores them as Platform documents.
- ## Commands
- dashpass put    --service <n> --type <t> --level <l> --value <v> [--label <l>]
- dashpass get    --service <n> [--json] [--pipe]
- dashpass list   [--type <t>] [--level <l>] [--status <s>]
- dashpass delete --service <n>
- dashpass rotate --service <n> --new-value <v>
- dashpass check  --expiring-within <duration>
- dashpass status
- ## Pipe mode
- `--pipe` outputs only the raw value to stdout. All log/debug messages go to stderr.
